"data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 65286, "title": "阴阳先生", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/8a01d148ace0059b6c8fef7c5c3cf422.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>漂亮女鬼每晚一更來哄男主睡觉，恋母情结爆发的他竟愛上了女鬼，正准备和她人鬼行房时，道士爷爷及时出现救回了一条小命，原來女鬼的真实目的是...</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/07/KRg36F3eRm2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/07/yhE9rRmW4k2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/07/ph7Dp7wncB2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202403/07/pkAnu6VK7Z2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 65204, "title": "八部天龙", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9e5677f8406be88d0fe07924fe2b7ac2.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>楚家大少楚辰，天生帝王命格，修炼三年便可引得天劫，天赋恐怖如斯，却因三年前楚家灭门惨案，而深陷心魔劫中，幸得师姐舍身相助，得以脱困！为解心劫，听师命，下山而去，了结因果</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/08/n1B9gbsg7c2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/08/pM12yucVup2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/08/7JPAtYHsFK2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/08/HV6waU6tgT2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64924, "title": "我不是酒神", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/844680911e98097513876a5706eeb2e3.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>有钱聚餐喝酒，沒钱还钱？比喝酒我还沒怕过谁！路上意外救下喝醉的美女千金，沒想到竟被她破格提拔成心腹！不仅帮她挡酒，还征服了她的芳心！守护心爱之人，立于不败之地！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202404/19/xcvSxdD6ZU85/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64882, "title": "苍穹之上", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/f9bb0c0bb8142537df96e1cfb3d34845.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/dxMPQgcCPQ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/pVd9LDfAfY2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/X01tGPa5H92/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/14/r7Lzw6UUdC2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64668, "title": "重回末日前", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/3ad870e852e1942028612ed13c5751a3.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>知道末日即将到来的我，调用一切可以撬动的杠杆，收集资金换取物资，抵挡末日的到来...</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/17/Xb0cbSKkR62/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/17/jT075qFgNh2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/17/mLRqp70quu2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/17/LAkNp2ezw52/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-99集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/17/3HUXGqF4BZ2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64634, "title": "系统提示，您的钱已到账", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/cf5e08e0e3943f7eba4f1f661992baa4.png", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>跑个出租车遇到一堆奇葩，意外开启最強滴滴系統？新手大礼包就送豪车和一个亿！女友背叛，那随她去吧！完成系统給出的任务，美人金钱双收，逆袭走向巅峰！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/CBgUhCAAZN2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/mxGx3vT8LC2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/WcL0MjdeG22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/SWx5gfQp7V2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64631, "title": "风流小神医和四个绝色师姐", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/cd7ec588c313f5df6eb08b5f3b9dfe6a.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>我在战中被五毒阵所困，还被蛊王偷袭！幸亏我功力深厚，將蛊王打退！沒想到，世界却认为师门被滅都是因为我！我定会解除误会，重回巅峰</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/b65DD0MCFk2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/MbGKxVap3t2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/JnHHZmCG1V2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/18/MHZzv6xBnT2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64481, "title": "天师下山，要相信科学", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/829cf60050c4110d1726d6e3f87be2c9.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>恶龙出世，祸乱人间？ 看我一剑斩之，打完收工！我虽继任至尊天师之位，但我尘缘未了，要下山壹趟！守护心爱之人，调查当年真相，亲手复仇！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/tQbzJNUQW02/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/bvUvqVccpf2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/NNCNNfn7B72/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/vsc3P94P4E2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/Vc8aPbGM5q2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64479, "title": "初恋他是神君大人", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/57773c3a605d42e8fd64d7dd3495d42a.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>我壹代仙君下凡渡劫，居然转生在窝囊废的身体！而我这次旅行下凡的任务，竟然是帮助我座下的仙草渡过天劫，和她喜结良缘！有我在，我看有谁敢动她！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/gSC87wKfnh2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/w1rxYnLMZW2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/irtq7D1Drh2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/xVh9u4xffb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/20/4Bvuya2axw2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64304, "title": "天命成王", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/e33d687f4d56d0c56452d13c8f09afd1.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>三年前，他被玄玄陷害却意外穿越幻世界，三年后，他神功大成破碎虚空回到地球旧账！强势回归又掌控无敌力量，势必血腥复仇。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/nUXkVrqUrZ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/9hbu6BhfCd2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/83d2FtcxTN2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/8DJpu74C8N2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/8GYevVBTN52/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64302, "title": "我真不是绝世高人", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/83c08160dcb7bdabf671757887f7026a.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>修炼时长二半，我终是没有突破练气期！九转开天功我练到了九百转，我真不是绝世高手！到底以为包办婚姻，竟然到了她上门退婚！我被赶下去了山，必须强制要和人联姻！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/dPQNt1upxa2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/7vj8PjKpg72/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/r89KzzzgS62/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/22/ySzDq3hZSK2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 64200, "title": "互换后，与渣男他弟恋爱了", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/dc333eedd72d3e5258eba72c2177c3b2.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>女人和千亿总裁互换身体，总裁维持三十年的高冷人设在一夜之间崩塌了！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/D3kA3zD8GH2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/Q44tKx0piu2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/Xd51qer2bT2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/VCkm9uUQjv2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "81-100集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/23/34tweUCvkL2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 63516, "title": "蟒雀吞龙", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/677046c38fcef44bffb66166be941d5f.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>小小蟒雀，安敢吞龙？今天，我就让你们知道什么是人定胜天！如今我飞升即在，是时候了却凡尘了！守护心爱之人，调查当年真相，清扫魑魅魍魉，走向大道巅峰</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/02/SACXFfWBUc2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/02/WTjinnn3FW2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/02/f9Y6Hzk1wc2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/02/QTj5EAnqz72/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 63376, "title": "我的手机连天界", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/8b34bb86164b880dfd00a12307eae97d.jpg", "year": "2024", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>小保安被人联合陷害，无意到竟开启珍稀任务！完成即可飞升上界，失败则壹切全无！为了守护自己视的一切，我不敬畏刀山火海，却意外征服了美女的芳心</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "1-20集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/YwWX2PpWqP2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "21-40集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/8USJtfb4pn2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "41-60集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/8ZkxrbCmku2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "61-80集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202404/04/JK8CgXVGts2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 59391, "title": "开局我在昆仑学院学斩神", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240102-1/2fff0f164d1264aa7378b9c311294b7a.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202404/14/j8iMeRJMkB74/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 59363, "title": "预知未来的神奇日记", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240102-1/65b5a671bade3ac791a8e00068fa5c52.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v7.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv7/202404/15/i8g5wxH9w879/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part12.json"}, {"id": 58989, "title": "绝世医尊", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231225-1/669df536441ff599d90c885f14a20b24.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.c